{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"复自旋结构"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“复自旋结构”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/spin%5Ec+structure\" title=\"nLab [https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/spin%5Ec+structure]\">nLab</a></span></p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对正整数 $n$, "},{"Local":{"url":"复自旋群","text":"复自旋群"}},{"Plain":" $\\text{Spin}^c(n)$ 是如下"},{"Local":{"url":"中心扩张","text":"中心扩张"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\nU(1) \\to \\text{Spin}^c(n) \\to SO(n).\r\n$$\n复自旋结构 ($\\text{spin}^c$ structure)</p>\n"}]}}